**Taker Fee (Tiered by Notional Value):**

| Tier | Notional Range | Fee |
|------|----------------|-----|
| Tier 1 | $0 - $50 | Flat $0.02 |
| Tier 2 | $50 - $500 | 5 bps (0.05%) |
| Tier 3 | $500 - $2,000 | 4 bps (0.04%) |
| Tier 4 | $2,000+ | 3 bps (0.03%) |

